    "group": "Data-psalm Conclave",
    "summary": "As the first battle round begins, pick one Benediction of the Omnissiah; it applies to your CULT MECHANICUS units for the rest of the battle. PANEGYRIC PROCESSION: each ranged attack by a CULT MECHANICUS model of yours against a target within half range improves its Armour Penetration by 1. CITATION IN SAVAGERY: when one of your CULT MECHANICUS units is picked to fight, provided it completed a Charge move earlier in the turn, the melee weapons of its models get +1 Strength and +1 Attacks until the phase ends.",
